           can be limited by using [1m--stat-graph-width=<width> [22mor by setting [1mdiff.statGraphWidth=<width>[22m. Using [1m--stat [22mor [1m--stat-graph-width [22maffects all commands generating a stat graph, while setting [1mdiff.statNameWidth [22mor
           [1mdiff.statGraphWidth [22mdoes not affect [1mgit format-patch[22m. By giving a third parameter [1m<count>[22m, you can limit the output to the first [1m<count> [22mlines, followed by [1m...  [22mif there are more.

           These parameters can also be set individually with [1m--stat-width=<width>[22m, [1m--stat-name-width=<name-width> [22mand [1m--stat-count=<count>[22m.

